# The font picker (docs/font-picker-plan.md §7). The guest lists the
# platform's families and their faces and labels what it asked for, since a
# scene cannot know another lane's faces: an exact face, a weight between two
# of a family's (the CSS matcher), a slope on a family with none (synthesized),
# and Bold and Italic over a light document (§3). Then the picker, code fonts
# with faces: its listing, a pick applied to a label, and a cancel that leaves
# the label as it was.
expect_title "fontpick"
click button@faces
expect label@ready "faces: found"
expect_face label@exact face label@want_exact
expect_face label@between face label@want_between
expect_face label@synth face label@want_synth
expect_face textarea@doc 0:4 face label@want_bold
expect_face textarea@doc 10:16 face label@want_italic
expect_face textarea@doc 22:27 face label@want_exact
click button@pick_button
expect_font_dialog code_only
pick_font label@pick
expect_font_dialog closed
expect label@picked "picked: as asked"
expect_face label@chosen named
expect_face label@chosen face label@want_pick
click button@pick_button
expect_font_dialog open
pick_font cancel
expect label@picked "picked: cancelled"
expect_face label@chosen face label@want_pick
